"MQTT needs a topic, like home/kitchen/temperature.":"MQTT ᛒᛖᚻᚩᚠᚪᚦ ᛁᚾᛏᛁᛝᚪᚾ, ᛋᚹᚪ home/kitchen/temperature.",
